        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Own door first and second floor one bedroom apartment. \r\nAdditional office room and attic conversion room with shower room. \r\nHighly sought after location.\r\nLocated within walking distance of UCD and a host of other amenities. \r\n1 x off-street car parking space with EV charging point. \r\nExtending to approximately 97 sq. m (1,044 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession. \r\n\r\nThis property provides its own door to first and second floor one bedroom apartment.  The property is comprised of a building arranged over ground and two upper floors. Internally the property comprises 1 x bedroom,  bathroom, office, kitchen, and a large living room on the first floor with an attic conversion room an ensuite located on the top floor. We are informed the property extends to approximately 97 sq. m (1,044 sq. ft). \r\n\r\nVacant possesion."
